// ============================================================
// DSA - Pattern-based roadmap
//
// Structured on Swati Ahuja's LeetCode Pattern Sheet: 94 patterns
// across 15 sections, 406 problems.  https://thita.ai/dsa-patterns-sheet
//
// Each pattern follows the same shape, built for recall rather than
// first reading:
//   the idea (one line)  ->  spot it  ->  the move  ->  PICTURE
//   ->  one fully traced example  ->  rest of the pattern  ->  trap
//   ->  why it matters  ->  core concepts  ->  complexity  ->  spotlight
//
// Diagrams use .learn-diagram (NOT .learn-code) so the renderer's C++
// highlighter leaves them alone and the dg-* spans survive.
// Code is C++.
// ============================================================

