<p class="learn-p">The minimum number of single-character <b>insert, delete or replace</b> operations to turn A into B. Same 2D table as LCS, but now a mismatch offers <b>three</b> repairs and you take the cheapest. The three neighbours of a cell correspond exactly to the three operations.</p>
